      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lembela malaika wa lukuta lwa mu Efeso ukuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya e mashiwi yafuma ku waikata intanda cine lubali mu cisansa cakwe ica ku kulyo, kabili uwendauka pakati ka fyakutekapo ifisaniko cine lubali ifyapangwa na golide.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine nalishiba imilimo wabomba. Nalishiba ifyo wabombesha nganshi nefyo washipikisha. Nalishiba ukuti taufwaya abantu babi nelyo panono. Nalishiba nokuti walyesha abantu abaleitunga ukuba abasole kanshi ninshi tefyo baba, no kusanga walisanga ukuti babepafye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe ulashipikisha, kabili ulacula pa mulandu wa ine ukwabula no kunenuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ninkwatapo ico ndeilishanya pali iwe. Iwe nomba tawantemwa nga filya wantemenwe pakutampa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tontonkanya ifyo wali kale ilyo wali taulanenuka. Kanshi lapila no kupilibuka, ulecita nefyo walecita pakutampa. Ukumfwa nga taulapile no kupilibuka, nkesa kuli iwe, nkafumye pa ncende yaciko icakutekapo icisaniko cobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo icinsansamushako kuli iwe nico walipata ificita abena Nikola ifyo na ine napata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
