              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esaya 62:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uuli na matwi, kanshi nakutike kufyo Mupashi alesosa ku nkuta!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuli uyo uwacimfya, nkamupeela mana uo bafisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mana uo bafisa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mana e cakulya Lesa apeele abena Israeli ilyo bali mu matololo. Mana uo babikile mu Mbokoshi ya cipangano (Ukuf 16:13-16,33).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Elyo kabili nkamupeela ne libwe ilyabuuta apalembwa ne shina ilipya ilyo umuntu nelyo umo ashaishiba, kanofye uyo wine uwalipokelela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lembela malaika wa lukuta lwa mu Tiyatila ukuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya e mashiwi yafuma kuli Mwana Lesa, uo amenso yakwe yabeka kwati lubingu lwa mulilo, na makasa yakwe yabengeshima kwati mukuba uwakuuswa bwino bwino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalishiba ifyo ucita. Nalishiba icitemwiko cobe, icisumino cobe, ifyo waba no mutima wakutumika, elyo no mutekatima obe. Nalishiba nokuti pali nomba ulebombesha ukucila ifyo walebomba pakutampa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.16.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Isham 16:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Isham 9:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ninkwatapo ico ndeilishanya pali iwe. Iwe tawacitapo nelyo cimo pali uyo mwanakashi Yesebele. Uyo mwanakashi aita ukuti ni kasesema. Ifyo alefunda filelenga abasha bandi ukuwila mukucita ubulalelale na mukulyako ifyakulya batuula ku tulubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalimupeela inshita yakulapila no kupilibuka. Lelo tafwaya kulapila pa bulalelale bwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico kanshi nkamulenga ukuti alwale, elyo nabo bonse ababembuka nankwe bakacula icibi. Efyo nkacita nga cakuti tabalapile no kupilibuka pa fibi balecita nankwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amalu 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yere 17:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.62.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amalu 62:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkepaya abana bakwe ku cinkunka. Elyo ne nkuta shonse shikeshiba ukuti nine naishiba bwino ifyaba mu mitima yenu nefyo mutontonkanya. Ine nkalipila umuntu onse ukulingana nefyo acita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lelo imwe bonse mwe bashala, mweba mu Tiyatila mwe bashakonka ifyo Yesebele afunda, imwe tamwasambililako ifyo batila, ‘e nkaama ine ine iyakwa Satana.’ Kanshi ine kwena nshilemulundilapo amafunde na yambi ayakumusakamika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo imwe mwikatishefye ifyo mwafundwa mpaka nkese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuli uyo uwacimfya, atwalilila no kucita ifyo mfwaya mpaka na ku mpela, nkamupeela amaka yakuteeka imishobo yonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
